WEBVTT

01:30.260 --> 01:34.990
[The Heir]

01:35.470 --> 01:37.940
[Episode 35]

01:41.229 --> 01:42.070
Zhen,

01:43.000 --> 01:45.330
my men still haven't uncovered anything.

01:45.759 --> 01:48.360
Perhaps the previous commotion
alerted them.

01:48.509 --> 01:49.509
Tian Benchang

01:50.070 --> 01:52.200
must have covered his tracks long ago.

01:56.920 --> 01:58.200
Thank you for your efforts,

01:58.200 --> 01:59.150
Cuiqiao.

01:59.920 --> 02:00.790
It's fine.

02:01.680 --> 02:03.210
If this path leads nowhere,

02:03.550 --> 02:04.810
I'll look for another.

02:05.760 --> 02:07.220
There will always be a way.

02:08.120 --> 02:09.289
Thank you, Zhen,

02:10.590 --> 02:12.270
for being willing to go to such lengths

02:12.270 --> 02:13.550
for Qi Jiu's sake.

02:14.400 --> 02:15.870
Knowing that, he can rest easier

02:15.870 --> 02:17.120
even in prison.

02:29.470 --> 02:30.750
The water's gone cold.

02:31.190 --> 02:33.850
Why hasn't the server come to
add more charcoal?

02:34.310 --> 02:35.370
Valued customers!

02:37.870 --> 02:39.120
My deepest apologies,

02:39.120 --> 02:40.470
valued customers!

02:40.710 --> 02:42.710
We've been terribly short-handed lately,

02:42.710 --> 02:44.170
so we've kept you waiting.

02:44.190 --> 02:45.910
Please forgive us.

02:46.310 --> 02:47.520
Didn't Prefect He

02:47.520 --> 02:49.030
issue an order just a few days ago

02:49.030 --> 02:50.360
encouraging businesses

02:50.360 --> 02:51.960
to take in refugees for work?

02:52.800 --> 02:55.150
Teahouse work doesn't require much skill.

02:55.150 --> 02:56.950
How are you still short of staff?

02:57.000 --> 02:57.960
To be honest,

02:58.470 --> 02:59.710
we did

02:59.710 --> 03:01.570
hire quite a few refugees before.

03:01.710 --> 03:03.400
But... But...

03:03.630 --> 03:05.310
Hasn't the recent riot

03:05.310 --> 03:06.750
mostly been suppressed?

03:06.910 --> 03:09.280
Those refugees who have land

03:09.470 --> 03:10.750
and family back home

03:10.800 --> 03:12.530
have long been eager to return.

03:12.630 --> 03:13.800
Many people

03:13.870 --> 03:14.870
just up and left

03:14.870 --> 03:16.270
without so much as a word.

03:16.400 --> 03:18.590
And since they aren't locals
we know well,

03:18.590 --> 03:19.560
where are we supposed to look for them?

03:19.560 --> 03:21.030
We wouldn't even know
where to start looking.

03:21.030 --> 03:23.150
That's why we've kept you waiting.

03:23.150 --> 03:24.840
Please b-bear with us, customers.

03:24.840 --> 03:25.680
Bear with us.

03:27.590 --> 03:30.250
Alright, we'll bring
more charcoal right over.

03:33.520 --> 03:34.560
Cuiqiao.

03:35.470 --> 03:36.310
I'm thinking

03:37.000 --> 03:39.870
the people Tian Benchang hired
may not have been ink-makers at all

03:39.870 --> 03:40.960
but refugees.

03:41.630 --> 03:42.470
Refugees?

03:42.470 --> 03:43.270
That's right.

03:43.310 --> 03:44.750
Refugees wouldn't know
the customs of the ink trade.

03:44.750 --> 03:46.000
Most of them are illiterate,

03:46.000 --> 03:47.360
and their whereabouts are uncertain.

03:47.360 --> 03:48.240
Today they work here;

03:48.240 --> 03:49.240
tomorrow somewhere else.

03:49.240 --> 03:51.750
They're easy to control
and difficult to trace.

03:51.750 --> 03:52.520
I think

03:52.870 --> 03:53.930
that may be exactly

03:54.030 --> 03:55.890
why Tian Benchang targeted them.

04:00.240 --> 04:01.840
Madam Wang, Miss Li Zhen,

04:02.030 --> 04:03.560
there's a message from Master Qi.

04:03.560 --> 04:04.470
Give it to me.

04:05.910 --> 04:08.000
"I suddenly recalled the night
I sneaked into the ink workshop

04:08.000 --> 04:09.190
and saw straw mats.

04:09.280 --> 04:10.910
Perhaps you can investigate
among the refugees."

04:10.910 --> 04:12.910
Cuiqiao, look.

04:18.480 --> 04:20.880
Refugees often carry their own straw mats.

04:21.600 --> 04:24.720
If Qi Jiu saw straw mats when he
snuck into the workshop that night,

04:24.720 --> 04:26.310
those workers were very likely refugees.

04:26.310 --> 04:28.170
You two thought of the same thing.

04:31.870 --> 04:32.870
Miss Tian,

04:33.240 --> 04:35.100
this is where I must take my leave.

04:35.510 --> 04:36.600
Madam says

04:36.800 --> 04:38.750
she is fully aware of every deed

04:38.750 --> 04:39.950
your family has done.

04:40.159 --> 04:42.310
You've managed to cozy up to Commander Wu

04:42.310 --> 04:44.500
and have helped him smear Marshal Qi.

04:44.950 --> 04:47.270
By doing so, you've severed all ties
with the Xu family.

04:47.270 --> 04:50.480
Madam will never
have anything to do with you again.

04:54.920 --> 04:56.159
My Lady, please.

05:01.720 --> 05:03.320
My Lady, don't keep looking.

05:03.870 --> 05:06.130
There'll be trouble if someone sees you.

05:12.750 --> 05:13.510
Ronghua?

05:15.800 --> 05:16.510
Ronghua.

05:17.040 --> 05:17.830
Ronghua.

05:18.920 --> 05:19.780
Stop the sedan.

05:23.720 --> 05:24.650
What do you want?

05:24.830 --> 05:25.430
Silence.

05:25.920 --> 05:26.980
Mind your manners.

05:27.750 --> 05:28.630
Yes, My Lady.

05:34.950 --> 05:36.310
When did you come back?

05:37.390 --> 05:38.520
Just arrived today.

05:42.920 --> 05:44.250
You just got back today?

05:45.680 --> 05:46.510
That's good.

05:48.630 --> 05:51.560
You haven't had a chance
to look around yet, have you?

05:51.600 --> 05:54.200
Huizhou has changed
quite a bit since you left.

05:54.310 --> 05:55.870
New jewelry,

05:56.600 --> 05:58.920
silks, rouge, and face powder...

05:59.390 --> 06:00.160
Also,

06:00.310 --> 06:02.800
a new sweet soup shop opened over there.

06:03.240 --> 06:04.800
It tastes exactly like what we had

06:04.800 --> 06:05.800
when we were kids.

06:06.750 --> 06:08.270
If you ever want to go,

06:09.510 --> 06:10.430
I'll take you.

06:12.390 --> 06:15.630
Alright, you must be tired
from traveling today.

06:15.870 --> 06:16.930
Head home and rest.

06:19.240 --> 06:19.950
Go on.

06:25.310 --> 06:26.120
Zhen.

06:37.560 --> 06:38.870
Why are you crying?

06:42.360 --> 06:43.480
Don't cry.

06:45.800 --> 06:47.920
Zhen, I was wrong.

06:49.800 --> 06:51.190
I was wrong, Zhen.

06:54.360 --> 06:56.040
I really missed you.

06:58.560 --> 07:00.430
Forgive me, Zhen.

07:04.240 --> 07:05.360
Silly girl.

07:07.950 --> 07:09.810
What matters is that you're back.

07:11.430 --> 07:12.690
As long as you're back.

07:13.430 --> 07:16.310
[Changsheng Garden]

07:32.560 --> 07:33.390
Ronghua,

07:34.240 --> 07:35.600
Lord Xu really

07:36.070 --> 07:38.510
has cut all ties with us?

07:39.920 --> 07:41.800
You think Lord Xu is unaware

07:43.120 --> 07:44.870
of the things you've done?

07:45.560 --> 07:48.360
It was only because the Emperor favors
ritual poems,

07:48.360 --> 07:51.040
which require fine paper and ink,

07:51.390 --> 07:53.750
that Lord Xu was willing to
give us a leg up.

07:54.430 --> 07:56.120
But now you're fawning

07:56.630 --> 07:58.159
over Commander Wu instead,

07:58.510 --> 08:01.110
and you even dare to
make an enemy of Marshal Qi.

08:02.560 --> 08:03.240
Father,

08:04.360 --> 08:06.720
Lord Xu is a distinguished official
of the realm.

08:06.720 --> 08:09.320
How could he have
any more involvement with us?

08:10.800 --> 08:12.750
What about Sage Qing He?

08:12.750 --> 08:15.160
I've long known that Lord Xu cares
too much about his reputation

08:15.160 --> 08:17.290
to be someone we could rely on forever.

08:17.480 --> 08:19.830
As for Sage Qing He,
his influence is waning.

08:19.830 --> 08:22.230
Since neither of them
can be depended upon,

08:22.390 --> 08:24.650
better to cut ties with them completely.

08:25.070 --> 08:27.390
Now that Commander Wu is behind us,

08:28.360 --> 08:30.360
what need do we still have for Lord Xu

08:31.120 --> 08:32.470
or that fake Taoist?

08:32.789 --> 08:35.320
Brother, I'm afraid
you've also abandoned me

08:35.840 --> 08:37.200
along with them.

08:40.549 --> 08:42.510
What are you talking about, Ronghua?

08:42.510 --> 08:44.910
How could I bear to
cast my own sister aside?

08:45.740 --> 08:46.620
Look,

08:47.630 --> 08:48.390
didn't I send people

08:48.390 --> 08:50.030
to bring you home properly?

08:51.990 --> 08:53.590
You just need to be obedient.

08:54.030 --> 08:55.760
Lord Xu may have abandoned you,

08:57.240 --> 08:59.240
but you've seen far more of the world

08:59.720 --> 09:01.380
than the rest of us, after all.

09:02.120 --> 09:03.960
There will be plenty of times ahead

09:03.960 --> 09:05.960
when I'll still need to count on you.

09:06.630 --> 09:07.440
Yes.

09:07.840 --> 09:08.600
Ronghua,

09:09.240 --> 09:11.640
as they say,
siblings share the same heart.

09:12.200 --> 09:13.330
When the time comes,

09:13.750 --> 09:16.270
you'll have to support each other.

09:18.000 --> 09:20.670
Sister, you've returned home in glory.

09:24.630 --> 09:26.360
The journey from the Capital

09:26.630 --> 09:27.720
has exhausted me.

09:28.150 --> 09:29.610
All I want now is some rest.

09:29.910 --> 09:31.570
As for your affairs, Brother,

09:32.200 --> 09:33.930
I'm afraid I won't be much help.

09:35.930 --> 09:37.770
Where are you going? Stop.

09:38.360 --> 09:39.120
Look at her,

09:39.440 --> 09:41.000
she's been spoiled by life in the Capital.

09:41.000 --> 09:42.670
Stop talking, dear!

09:42.870 --> 09:44.330
Ronghua, wait for Mother.

09:53.550 --> 09:54.150
Benchang.

09:55.600 --> 09:57.260
We have a letter from Nanjing.

10:08.200 --> 10:09.320
Those bastards!

10:10.030 --> 10:11.890
Do they take our family for a bank?

10:12.150 --> 10:13.350
Calm down, Benchang.

10:13.360 --> 10:14.750
What happened?

10:15.000 --> 10:17.510
Wu Weishi said there is another person
in the Capital

10:17.510 --> 10:20.630
eyeing the vacant post
in the Directorate of Imperial Household.

10:20.630 --> 10:22.240
With two bidders in the race,

10:22.600 --> 10:23.840
the amount we originally agreed upon

10:23.840 --> 10:25.480
is no longer enough to grease the wheels.

10:25.480 --> 10:26.940
How much more do they want?

10:29.320 --> 10:30.360
Five thousand taels.

10:30.360 --> 10:31.600
Five thousand taels?

10:31.720 --> 10:32.240
Well...

10:33.200 --> 10:35.730
And the money must be raised
within one month.

10:42.480 --> 10:45.280
How many sticks of ink
from that workshop are left?

10:45.670 --> 10:47.790
Roughly 1,000 sticks.

10:49.120 --> 10:50.360
But even selling all of them

10:50.360 --> 10:51.890
won't add up to 5,000 taels.

10:56.960 --> 10:58.890
We'll have to think of another way.

10:59.720 --> 11:00.320
Benchang,

11:00.510 --> 11:01.630
one more thing.

11:02.870 --> 11:04.550
Li Zhen has still been secretly

11:04.550 --> 11:06.510
digging around, trying to find our flaws.

11:06.510 --> 11:09.570
She seems to have found a lead
pointing to the refugees.

11:09.960 --> 11:11.150
Hasn't Officer Zhang already gotten

11:11.150 --> 11:12.200
the official document
signed by the Prefect?

11:12.200 --> 11:12.840
Yes.

11:12.870 --> 11:15.150
Then why is Li Zhen still
running around stirring things up?

11:15.150 --> 11:17.910
The Lis did appear obediently before
the prefectural office several times.

11:17.910 --> 11:19.720
But no problems
could be found in their accounts,

11:19.720 --> 11:22.080
and in court,
they answered every question flawlessly.

11:22.080 --> 11:24.510
So, Zhang doesn't dare push them further.

11:27.120 --> 11:27.650
Brother,

11:28.320 --> 11:29.750
with your current status,

11:29.750 --> 11:31.610
you could have any woman you want.

11:31.670 --> 11:33.600
Why do you keep fixating on Li Zhen?

11:34.630 --> 11:35.870
After Luo Wenqian was imprisoned,

11:35.870 --> 11:37.360
Commander Wu specifically wrote to us,

11:37.360 --> 11:39.960
instructing us to handle
the matter properly.

11:40.440 --> 11:40.970
Brother,

11:42.320 --> 11:45.150
this time we must steel our hearts.

11:45.200 --> 11:46.670
We cannot go soft on Li Zhen anymore.

11:46.670 --> 11:48.070
You don't need to tell me.

11:50.510 --> 11:51.910
I'll deal with it myself.

11:57.270 --> 11:58.200
Manager Zhen.

12:00.320 --> 12:01.080
We've found

12:01.080 --> 12:02.150
a refugee who worked for the Tian family.

12:02.150 --> 12:03.030
He's in the warehouse right now,

12:03.030 --> 12:03.840
waiting for your questioning.

12:03.840 --> 12:04.550
Let's go.

12:06.960 --> 12:07.750
Mr. Xiao?

12:13.670 --> 12:14.510
Mr. Xiao.

12:15.720 --> 12:16.580
This is the man.

12:20.150 --> 12:21.150
Tell the truth.

12:21.150 --> 12:23.440
Did you make ink for the Tian family?

12:24.240 --> 12:25.870
N-No.

12:25.870 --> 12:27.510
I didn't do anything.

12:27.750 --> 12:29.080
Still denying it?

12:29.910 --> 12:31.510
If you never worked for the Tian family,

12:31.510 --> 12:33.320
what's in this bag of yours?

12:36.870 --> 12:37.630
Miss Li Zhen,

12:38.480 --> 12:39.440
look at this.

12:41.630 --> 12:42.630
A Japanese coin.

12:43.390 --> 12:44.080
Exactly.

12:49.910 --> 12:53.480
Possessing Japanese currency in secret
is a serious crime.

12:53.790 --> 12:56.120
If you don't tell us everything you know,

12:56.480 --> 12:58.750
we'll hand you over
to the authorities right now.

12:58.750 --> 12:59.360
I...

13:00.510 --> 13:02.720
I don't know anything.

13:06.320 --> 13:07.240
Mr. Xiao,

13:08.200 --> 13:10.320
where did you find him?

13:12.670 --> 13:13.750
Over the past few days,

13:13.750 --> 13:15.750
we've been searching for refugees.

13:15.960 --> 13:17.960
But the Tian family is extremely cunning.

13:17.960 --> 13:19.560
The refugees they hired have

13:19.720 --> 13:23.080
either secretly moved elsewhere
along with their ink workshops

13:23.080 --> 13:24.670
and vanished without a trace

13:24.670 --> 13:27.270
or been sent straight back
to their hometowns.

13:27.360 --> 13:29.150
It took us a lot of effort

13:29.240 --> 13:31.100
before finally finding this man.

13:31.240 --> 13:33.320
He'd stolen something from the Tian family

13:33.320 --> 13:34.850
and, fearing retaliation,

13:35.200 --> 13:37.630
hid himself in some back alley
in the old district.

13:37.630 --> 13:40.240
We staked the place out for days
before catching him.

13:40.240 --> 13:41.790
And he's particularly uncooperative—

13:41.790 --> 13:44.390
he started yelling
after just a few questions.

13:44.440 --> 13:46.000
Afraid of drawing
the Tian family's attention,

13:46.000 --> 13:47.670
we brought him back first.

13:50.240 --> 13:51.600
When you seized him,

13:52.550 --> 13:53.880
did anyone else see you?

13:54.120 --> 13:55.120
Search the place!

13:58.870 --> 14:00.080
Help!

14:00.240 --> 14:01.480
Somebody help!

14:01.750 --> 14:02.600
Mr. Xiao!

14:02.910 --> 14:04.770
Japanese coins, Japanese coins.

14:06.270 --> 14:08.000
Officers, officers.

14:08.000 --> 14:09.150
What do you think you're doing?

14:09.150 --> 14:10.840
This is unlawful trespass!

14:10.840 --> 14:11.910
Are you Wu Xin?

14:12.080 --> 14:12.670
Yes.

14:13.240 --> 14:14.670
I am Wu Xin.

14:16.320 --> 14:17.380
This man's brother

14:17.600 --> 14:20.260
has sued you
for illegally detaining refugees.

14:20.580 --> 14:22.160
And judging by what we've found today,

14:22.160 --> 14:23.320
it appears the accusation is true.

14:23.320 --> 14:24.670
Officer,

14:24.790 --> 14:27.200
please save me!

14:28.200 --> 14:29.200
A few days ago,

14:29.750 --> 14:32.110
people from the Li Ink Workshop
secretly approached me

14:32.110 --> 14:33.490
and brought me to their workshop.

14:33.490 --> 14:35.240
They claimed they wanted me to work there,

14:35.240 --> 14:36.670
but what they had me making

14:36.670 --> 14:38.840
was contraband ink
for illicit foreign trade!

14:38.840 --> 14:40.440
I had no way to escape

14:40.600 --> 14:42.130
and was held there for days!

14:42.270 --> 14:45.000
Fortunately, you officers came
to save me today!

14:45.000 --> 14:46.000
Officer,

14:46.360 --> 14:48.870
you must bring me justice!

14:48.870 --> 14:49.730
Officer Zhang,

14:49.870 --> 14:50.600
Officer Zhang,

14:50.600 --> 14:51.720
he's lying!

14:51.790 --> 14:52.960
This is a frame-up!

14:53.030 --> 14:54.090
You are framing us!

14:54.630 --> 14:57.750
Officer, every word I've said is true.

14:57.770 --> 14:59.000
If you don't believe me, look—

14:59.000 --> 15:01.030
this is proof
of their illicit foreign trade.

15:01.030 --> 15:02.000
Shut up!

15:02.960 --> 15:04.630
This was found on him.

15:07.200 --> 15:09.400
Illicit foreign trade is a grave crime.

15:09.910 --> 15:10.720
Officers,

15:11.000 --> 15:13.440
take everyone involved back
to the prefectural office for questioning!

15:13.440 --> 15:13.840
Yes, sir!

15:13.840 --> 15:15.240
I'd like to see who dares!

15:16.510 --> 15:17.120
Let's talk this through calmly!

15:17.120 --> 15:18.630
Mr. Xiao, Doggie!

15:18.750 --> 15:19.550
Let go!

15:21.670 --> 15:22.550
Fine.

15:23.550 --> 15:25.950
Since someone has deliberately framed us,

15:26.240 --> 15:28.440
we'll fight this to the very end.

15:29.000 --> 15:29.750
Perfect.

15:29.870 --> 15:31.750
We'll take this matter before the Prefect

15:31.750 --> 15:33.210
and get to the bottom of it.

15:35.320 --> 15:36.120
Let's go.

15:43.630 --> 15:44.960
Court is now in session.

15:45.030 --> 15:51.120
Silence and order!

15:54.240 --> 15:55.240
Your Excellency,

15:55.550 --> 15:57.910
all members of the Li family
have been brought in.

15:57.910 --> 15:59.440
Li Zhen, Li Ink's head manager,

15:59.440 --> 16:00.670
and Li Jingdong, its proprietor,

16:00.670 --> 16:02.200
are present to stand trial.

16:05.390 --> 16:08.790
This is the evidence
of illicit foreign trade found at Li Ink.

16:17.750 --> 16:18.510
Li Zhen,

16:18.910 --> 16:19.750
Li Jingdong,

16:20.080 --> 16:21.390
do you admit your guilt?

16:21.390 --> 16:22.390
Your Excellency,

16:22.600 --> 16:24.750
Li Ink has been established in Huizhou
for over a century.

16:24.750 --> 16:27.030
For 100 years,
we have been honest and law-abiding.

16:27.030 --> 16:29.840
Never once have we committed
even a breach of trust,

16:29.840 --> 16:33.240
let alone a crime as heinous as
trading with foreign enemies.

16:33.320 --> 16:34.720
The pouch of Japanese coins,

16:34.720 --> 16:36.000
along with this man,

16:36.320 --> 16:37.510
must be a deliberate setup by someone

16:37.510 --> 16:38.320
to frame us!

16:38.750 --> 16:40.320
I implore Your Excellency to see through

16:40.320 --> 16:42.320
this scheme
and restore Li Ink's innocence!

16:42.320 --> 16:43.150
Your Excellency,

16:43.150 --> 16:44.150
I found that pouch of

16:44.150 --> 16:45.510
Japanese coins by chance

16:45.510 --> 16:46.770
in Li Ink's warehouse.

16:46.870 --> 16:48.240
The moment I saw them,

16:48.240 --> 16:49.900
I was terrified out of my wits.

16:49.910 --> 16:51.750
But I knew the matter
was too serious to ignore,

16:51.750 --> 16:53.200
so I dared not dispose of them myself.

16:53.200 --> 16:54.630
That's why I kept them in my bundle.

16:54.630 --> 16:55.630
Your Excellency,

16:56.080 --> 16:57.790
Wu Xin is spouting pure fabrication

16:57.790 --> 16:59.120
and slander!

17:05.480 --> 17:06.480
Officer Zhang,

17:07.030 --> 17:09.000
you visited our ink workshop just now.

17:09.000 --> 17:09.880
May I ask,

17:10.310 --> 17:12.030
did you see even the slightest sign

17:12.030 --> 17:14.290
of contraband ink being produced there?

17:14.310 --> 17:16.030
Since you dare to
engage in illicit foreign trade,

17:16.030 --> 17:17.720
you must be extremely careful.

17:17.720 --> 17:19.589
How could you possibly
leave any obvious traces?

17:19.589 --> 17:20.480
Well said.

17:21.069 --> 17:22.880
Your Excellency, think carefully.

17:22.880 --> 17:24.109
If we were

17:24.160 --> 17:25.400
capable of erasing every trace

17:25.400 --> 17:27.109
of illicit ink production so completely,

17:27.109 --> 17:29.110
then why would we carelessly
leave that pouch of Japanese coins

17:29.110 --> 17:30.640
lying in the warehouse,

17:30.720 --> 17:32.960
only for Wu Xin to stumble upon it?

17:33.240 --> 17:34.070
Your Excellency,

17:34.070 --> 17:35.110
doesn't all of this seem

17:35.110 --> 17:36.640
far too suspicious?

17:37.310 --> 17:38.910
That was your one oversight.

17:39.030 --> 17:40.480
You gave yourselves away.

17:40.480 --> 17:42.480
And Heaven itself has chosen
to punish you!

17:42.480 --> 17:43.480
Your Excellency,

17:44.200 --> 17:45.880
after I was taken to Li Ink's workshop,

17:45.880 --> 17:48.270
I personally saw the contraband ink

17:48.310 --> 17:50.000
and the various tools used to make it.

17:50.000 --> 17:52.920
Those things were not accessible
to ordinary ink-makers.

17:52.920 --> 17:54.720
Because I was a refugee from out of town,

17:54.720 --> 17:56.480
they forced me to work for them.

17:56.830 --> 17:58.920
Everything I've said is the truth.

17:58.920 --> 17:59.680
Very well!

18:00.200 --> 18:01.330
Then answer me this—

18:02.070 --> 18:03.200
since you claim

18:03.400 --> 18:05.260
we brought you to the ink workshop

18:05.400 --> 18:07.200
to make contraband ink for us,

18:07.750 --> 18:09.030
you must know

18:09.240 --> 18:10.960
how we make all kinds of inks.

18:12.240 --> 18:13.160
Tell me—

18:13.350 --> 18:15.310
what type of ink

18:15.310 --> 18:16.960
was the contraband ink you saw,

18:16.960 --> 18:18.110
and how was it made?

18:18.480 --> 18:19.640
You told me that

18:20.160 --> 18:23.070
what you were secretly producing was
your family's ancient lacquer-soot ink.

18:23.070 --> 18:25.510
The lampblack was made by
burning raw lacquer and tung oil,

18:25.510 --> 18:26.880
and deer-antler glue
was used as the binder.

18:26.880 --> 18:27.920
Since I'm a layman

18:28.270 --> 18:29.480
and had only just arrived at the workshop,

18:29.480 --> 18:31.740
I could only do some heavy pounding work.

18:31.830 --> 18:34.030
Manager Zhen, did I get anything wrong?

18:34.200 --> 18:37.270
Wu Xin, who told you all that?

18:37.350 --> 18:38.070
Speak!

18:38.070 --> 18:39.680
Who told you that?

18:41.680 --> 18:42.720
If so,

18:43.310 --> 18:44.830
you must have been

18:45.480 --> 18:47.000
in our smoke shed.

18:47.510 --> 18:49.040
How could you forget, Miss?

18:49.310 --> 18:50.880
The very first place you took me

18:50.880 --> 18:52.680
after bringing me to the workshop
was the smoke shed.

18:52.680 --> 18:53.720
Your smoke shed

18:54.030 --> 18:56.310
is located in the northwest corner
of your ink workshop.

18:56.310 --> 18:57.350
Am I right?

18:57.640 --> 18:58.570
That's correct.

18:59.240 --> 19:01.840
Then, what is the layout
inside the smoke shed?

19:02.400 --> 19:04.960
Naturally, the same as
any ordinary smoke shed.

19:04.960 --> 19:07.550
On one side are the pine-soot kilns
for burning pine wood,

19:07.550 --> 19:10.280
and on the other is the oil-soot shed
for oil soot.

19:10.720 --> 19:12.000
Your Excellency,

19:12.830 --> 19:15.000
several months ago, Huizhou was struck
by a pine wilt epidemic.

19:15.000 --> 19:15.960
Afterward, the Tian family

19:15.960 --> 19:17.750
forcibly requisitioned
our pine wood supplies,

19:17.750 --> 19:19.480
and then our workshop suffered a fire.

19:19.480 --> 19:21.920
Pine wood will remain scarce
for years to come.

19:21.920 --> 19:23.720
Therefore, after rebuilding,

19:23.750 --> 19:25.400
we renovated the smoke shed.

19:25.400 --> 19:27.160
The pine-soot kilns,
which were no longer needed,

19:27.160 --> 19:29.090
were moved to our old ink workshop.

19:29.110 --> 19:29.880
As a result,

19:30.310 --> 19:32.350
there are currently no pine-soot kilns

19:32.350 --> 19:33.720
in our smoke shed!

19:33.920 --> 19:34.590
Nonsense!

19:34.590 --> 19:36.550
Your Excellency, both facilities
were operating at the same time!

19:36.550 --> 19:37.480
Both facilities
were operating simultaneously!

19:37.480 --> 19:38.400
I saw it with my own eyes!

19:38.400 --> 19:39.350
Your Excellency,

19:39.350 --> 19:40.480
I dare say

19:40.810 --> 19:42.880
that no ink workshop in all of Huizhou

19:42.900 --> 19:44.480
could possibly operate
both pine-soot kilns

19:44.480 --> 19:47.140
and oil-soot sheds
simultaneously these days—

19:47.200 --> 19:48.160
except for

19:48.820 --> 19:51.200
the Tian Ink Workshop that seized

19:53.790 --> 19:55.000
our pine wood!

20:02.000 --> 20:02.510
Well...

20:04.200 --> 20:07.400
How did the Tian family
suddenly become involved in this?

20:08.480 --> 20:09.480
Your Excellency,

20:09.720 --> 20:10.480
before...

20:10.960 --> 20:12.790
before I worked at Li Ink,

20:12.920 --> 20:15.480
I'd worked in other ink workshops.

20:15.510 --> 20:17.480
I simply mixed them up for a moment.

20:17.550 --> 20:18.790
I had no intention of deceiving the court.

20:18.790 --> 20:20.550
I beg Your Excellency's understanding.

20:20.550 --> 20:21.240
Wu Xin,

20:21.590 --> 20:22.880
you speak nothing but lies

20:22.880 --> 20:24.210
and still dare to argue?

20:24.750 --> 20:26.790
Since you claim
you worked in other ink workshops,

20:26.790 --> 20:27.680
tell me—

20:27.720 --> 20:29.960
which workshop, where was it located,

20:29.960 --> 20:31.160
and who was the owner?

20:31.200 --> 20:32.000
Speak!

20:35.480 --> 20:37.070
Insolent Wu Xin,

20:37.200 --> 20:38.960
why have you suddenly gone silent?

20:38.960 --> 20:39.960
Your Excellency,

20:39.960 --> 20:42.640
this man's testimony contradicts itself.

20:42.640 --> 20:43.880
It's clear that someone

20:43.880 --> 20:45.270
has fed him this story behind the scenes

20:45.270 --> 20:46.510
to frame our family!

20:46.590 --> 20:48.440
We implore Your Excellency
to investigate thoroughly

20:48.440 --> 20:50.750
and redress the injustice done to us!

20:50.960 --> 20:53.590
We implore Your Excellency
to discern the truth!

20:53.590 --> 20:54.400
Wu Xin,

20:55.160 --> 20:57.620
if you can't
give a reasonable explanation,

20:57.680 --> 21:01.480
I will immediately convict you of framing!

21:01.720 --> 21:02.500
Your Excellency,

21:02.500 --> 21:04.070
I am innocent.

21:04.090 --> 21:05.460
I am innocent!

21:05.880 --> 21:08.270
-Speak!
-Say it!

21:09.400 --> 21:11.000
-Speak!
-Speak!

21:11.110 --> 21:11.640
Speak!

21:12.240 --> 21:13.100
Say something!

21:13.640 --> 21:14.160
Speak!

21:14.180 --> 21:15.180
Report!

21:29.650 --> 21:31.320
[Prefect He, evidence confirms
that Huizhou merchant Li Zhen]

21:31.320 --> 21:32.990
[has colluded with Japanese pirates
in illicit foreign trade.]

21:33.010 --> 21:34.650
[Given the threat to coastal security
and imperial law,]

21:34.650 --> 21:36.290
investigate without omission
and purge all traitors.]

21:40.750 --> 21:41.750
Your Excellency?

21:41.920 --> 21:43.350
In the matter of

21:43.880 --> 21:45.880
Li family's illicit foreign trade,

21:46.550 --> 21:48.640
the evidence and witness testimony
are now conclusive.

21:48.640 --> 21:50.040
By order of this Prefect,

21:51.750 --> 21:55.200
the Li residence and its ink workshops
are to be sealed at once.

21:55.200 --> 21:56.000
All members of the Li family,

21:56.000 --> 21:59.400
along with every ink-maker
connected to this case,

21:59.790 --> 22:01.070
are to be imprisoned at once

22:01.070 --> 22:02.880
and strictly investigated individually.

22:02.880 --> 22:03.610
As for Wu Xin,

22:03.750 --> 22:04.960
detain him for now.

22:05.070 --> 22:09.110
His disposition will be decided
once this case has been concluded.

22:10.070 --> 22:11.070
Your Excellency,

22:11.440 --> 22:13.000
what is the meaning of this?

22:13.480 --> 22:17.000
What new evidence was contained
in that letter just now

22:17.160 --> 22:21.070
that could cause you to
distort the facts so completely?

22:21.310 --> 22:22.310
Your Excellency,

22:22.520 --> 22:24.040
we're innocent!

22:24.060 --> 22:25.300
Enough! Say no more!

22:25.400 --> 22:26.720
Arrest Li Zhen and Li Jingdong

22:26.720 --> 22:27.830
immediately!

22:27.880 --> 22:28.830
Your Excellency!

22:28.830 --> 22:31.030
Your Excellency, please see the truth!

22:31.110 --> 22:32.110
Your Excellency!

22:32.200 --> 22:33.790
You're the guardian
of the people of Huizhou.

22:33.790 --> 22:35.240
How can you wrong the innocent?

22:35.240 --> 22:36.000
Your Excellency,

22:36.000 --> 22:37.550
we implore you to see clearly!

22:37.550 --> 22:38.480
Your Excellency!

22:38.480 --> 22:39.000
Your Excellency!

22:39.000 --> 22:40.480
Please see the truth!

22:46.550 --> 22:47.520
Court dismissed!

22:47.520 --> 22:49.810
Li Ink is innocent!

22:53.070 --> 22:54.800
Your Excellency, please wait!

22:58.350 --> 22:59.270
President Hu!

22:59.640 --> 23:00.770
Third Grandfather!

23:03.350 --> 23:05.550
We pay our respects to Your Excellency.

23:06.390 --> 23:08.750
I, Hu Xuanlin, president of
the Huizhou Literary Association,

23:08.750 --> 23:10.810
am willing to stand surety for Li Ink.

23:10.880 --> 23:13.200
Li Ink has upheld
its reputation for a century.

23:13.200 --> 23:16.230
How could they possibly engage in
illicit foreign trade?

23:16.230 --> 23:20.270
I, Chen Jiru, manager of Chen Ink,
vouch for the Li family!

23:21.110 --> 23:23.910
I, Huang Shan of Huang Ink,
vouch for the Li family.

23:24.920 --> 23:27.830
I, Pan Ruogu of Pan Ink,
vouch for the Li family.

23:28.200 --> 23:29.000
Yeah!

23:29.110 --> 23:30.400
-Yes!
-Yes!

23:30.480 --> 23:31.000
Great!

23:33.000 --> 23:35.030
What on earth are you doing?

23:35.560 --> 23:36.970
Stand down at once!

23:37.000 --> 23:38.880
Anyone who obstructs this official
in adjudicating the case

23:38.880 --> 23:40.750
will be charged as an accomplice.

23:41.400 --> 23:42.400
Your Excellency,

23:42.980 --> 23:45.650
Chen Ink and Li Ink
have been fellow members

23:45.680 --> 23:47.070
of the Huizhou ink industry
for many years.

23:47.070 --> 23:48.480
I, Chen Jiru,

23:48.550 --> 23:51.110
am well acquainted with the Li family.

23:51.200 --> 23:53.000
From the late Sixth Master Li

23:53.030 --> 23:54.430
to the Seventh Old Madam,

23:54.510 --> 23:56.240
every elder of the Li family

23:56.290 --> 23:59.140
was a person of virtue and standing
in town!

23:59.240 --> 24:00.590
With such family traditions,

24:00.590 --> 24:02.160
I firmly believe

24:02.160 --> 24:03.750
that the descendants of Li Ink today

24:03.750 --> 24:05.720
would not betray
their ancestors' teachings

24:05.720 --> 24:07.780
and engage in illicit foreign trade!

24:07.830 --> 24:09.430
I implore Your Excellency to

24:09.510 --> 24:12.970
investigate thoroughly
and not allow villains to frame them!

24:13.030 --> 24:13.880
Your Excellency,

24:13.880 --> 24:16.480
I am Pan Ruogu, descendant of Pan Ink.

24:16.790 --> 24:18.550
My father passed away only recently,

24:18.550 --> 24:21.030
and Manager Zhen of the Li family
showed us great kindness and support.

24:21.030 --> 24:23.110
Her integrity and righteousness
are a model for all.

24:23.110 --> 24:24.880
I beg Your Excellency for leniency.

24:24.880 --> 24:26.000
Your Excellency,

24:26.110 --> 24:27.550
we have not come here

24:27.750 --> 24:29.830
to challenge your authority.

24:30.070 --> 24:32.960
We ask only that you give
the Li family a chance.

24:33.200 --> 24:35.960
Now that the Li family stands accused,

24:36.200 --> 24:39.550
surely they should be allowed to
prove their innocence!

24:41.920 --> 24:42.920
Your Excellency,

24:43.790 --> 24:44.880
I, Li Jingdong,

24:45.650 --> 24:48.690
am willing to be imprisoned
pending investigation

24:49.010 --> 24:51.160
along with the entire
sixth and seventh branches of the family.

24:51.160 --> 24:51.510
Uncle Jingdong...

24:51.510 --> 24:54.590
But the eighth branch
of our family was expelled

24:54.640 --> 24:57.030
from the clan more than 10 years ago.

24:57.370 --> 24:59.100
Even if the Li family is guilty,

24:59.550 --> 25:03.270
the punishment shouldn't extend to
those who were already cast out.

25:03.270 --> 25:04.270
Your Excellency,

25:04.680 --> 25:07.160
this has been the principle

25:07.160 --> 25:09.490
of the Huizhou clans since ancient times.

25:10.200 --> 25:11.640
I beg Your Excellency

25:13.350 --> 25:14.810
to show some flexibility.

25:15.720 --> 25:16.780
Uncle Jingdong...

25:17.830 --> 25:19.000
Uncle Jingdong.

25:19.160 --> 25:21.000
Please make an exception,
Your Excellency!

25:21.000 --> 25:22.460
Please, Your Excellency!

25:23.030 --> 25:24.240
Order, order!

25:26.790 --> 25:30.720
The laws of this dynasty are
rooted in clan customs and traditions,

25:30.960 --> 25:31.590
but

25:32.400 --> 25:35.070
Li Zhen is the manager of Li Ink,

25:35.680 --> 25:36.480
so she cannot

25:37.510 --> 25:39.350
stay out of this matter.

25:40.030 --> 25:43.430
Your Excellency, I have no intention
of staying uninvolved!

25:44.750 --> 25:45.830
Today, I'm

25:46.510 --> 25:49.770
honored to have the elders
of the ink industry vouch for me.

25:50.160 --> 25:52.690
I humbly request
20 days from Your Excellency

25:52.720 --> 25:55.270
to prove the innocence of

25:55.530 --> 25:56.860
the Li family and Li Ink!

25:57.880 --> 25:58.880
Your Excellency,

26:00.480 --> 26:02.410
the Huizhou Literary Association

26:02.480 --> 26:05.030
is willing to stand surety
for Li Zhen, manager of Li Ink.

26:05.030 --> 26:07.240
Please give Li Ink a chance

26:07.680 --> 26:09.310
to prove their innocence!

26:10.880 --> 26:14.410
Your Excellency, Chen Ink is willing to
stand surety for Li Ink!

26:14.920 --> 26:18.110
Your Excellency, Pan Ink is also
willing to vouch for the Li family!

26:18.110 --> 26:19.680
Please show mercy, Your Excellency!

26:19.680 --> 26:21.880
Huang Ink is willing to vouch for Li Ink!

26:22.200 --> 26:23.790
Please show leniency!

26:23.790 --> 26:27.120
-Please grant them this chance!
-Please, Your Excellency!

26:30.270 --> 26:31.440
Order!

26:36.960 --> 26:37.550
Fine.

26:39.480 --> 26:40.110
Li Zhen,

26:41.030 --> 26:42.630
I will grant you this chance.

26:42.680 --> 26:43.790
But 20 days is too long.

26:43.790 --> 26:45.920
I can only give you half a month.

26:46.030 --> 26:47.090
After half a month,

26:47.160 --> 26:48.880
this court will reconvene.

26:49.640 --> 26:52.040
If by then you cannot
prove your innocence,

26:52.110 --> 26:54.840
I will pass the full sentence
according to the law

26:55.310 --> 26:57.170
and show no leniency whatsoever.

26:57.550 --> 26:58.720
I, Li Zhen,

26:59.590 --> 27:00.920
thank Your Excellency!

27:01.960 --> 27:05.290
-Thank you, Your Excellency!
-Thank you, Your Excellency!

27:11.590 --> 27:12.400
Detain

27:12.960 --> 27:13.880
Li Jingdong.

27:19.460 --> 27:20.460
Court dismissed!

27:20.510 --> 27:23.170
-Yes, Your Excellency!
-Yes, Your Excellency!

27:24.310 --> 27:25.240
Uncle Jingdong.

27:25.790 --> 27:26.720
Uncle Jingdong.

27:33.920 --> 27:34.980
Uncle Jingdong...

27:35.720 --> 27:36.550
Zhen,

27:37.720 --> 27:38.680
don't be sad.

27:39.550 --> 27:41.920
Go do what you need to do.

27:42.680 --> 27:43.830
Our entire family

27:44.270 --> 27:45.830
is counting on you now.

27:53.110 --> 27:54.160
Uncle Jingdong!

27:54.270 --> 27:55.030
Jingdong.

28:08.920 --> 28:09.850
Uncle Jingdong,

28:10.830 --> 28:12.030
don't worry!

28:23.930 --> 28:27.480
[Huizhou Prefecture Office]

28:24.310 --> 28:24.830
Zhen.

28:24.860 --> 28:26.590
-Zhen!
-Mother, Grandfather.

28:27.990 --> 28:29.470
You had us worried sick!

28:31.640 --> 28:32.440
Grandfather,

28:33.200 --> 28:35.070
Uncle Jingdong, Third Aunt,

28:35.510 --> 28:37.640
and Eldest Aunt have all been taken...

28:40.830 --> 28:42.960
It's the Tian family framing us again.

28:43.160 --> 28:45.240
No, we can't just let this go.

28:45.350 --> 28:46.830
I'm going in there right now
to confront them!

28:46.830 --> 28:47.880
Mother, come back.

28:47.880 --> 28:49.210
Who would you confront?

28:50.880 --> 28:52.000
Just now in court,

28:52.030 --> 28:53.440
we exposed the villain's plot

28:53.440 --> 28:54.640
to frame us.

28:54.920 --> 28:55.980
But I didn't expect

28:56.040 --> 28:57.960
the Prefect to suddenly receive a letter

28:57.960 --> 28:59.030
and change his stance on the spot.

28:59.030 --> 28:59.880
I guess

29:00.110 --> 29:01.750
it must have been
some high-ranking official in Nanjing

29:01.750 --> 29:03.750
backing the Tian family who intervened.

29:03.750 --> 29:05.720
Tian Benchang has planned everything.

29:05.720 --> 29:07.850
What good would it do to confront them?

29:08.270 --> 29:10.310
That family is truly rotten to the core.

29:10.310 --> 29:12.640
Then... what about

29:12.640 --> 29:14.440
Eldest Aunt and Uncle Jingdong?

29:15.070 --> 29:17.470
The Tian family has powerful connections.

29:17.640 --> 29:19.790
We'll have to seek our own connections.

29:19.790 --> 29:22.240
Princess Shouyang has always
held our family in high regard.

29:22.240 --> 29:24.920
I'll leave for Nanjing at once
to seek an audience with Her Highness.

29:24.920 --> 29:27.310
If she is willing to show us any favor,

29:27.680 --> 29:29.280
then there is still a chance.

29:30.440 --> 29:32.070
Mother, let's go first.

29:32.150 --> 29:32.750
Let's go.

29:37.640 --> 29:40.160
Those old fogies
with one foot in the grave

29:40.590 --> 29:42.070
dare to ruin my plans.

29:43.400 --> 29:44.240
Bensheng.

29:44.940 --> 29:46.340
You must keep a close watch

29:46.340 --> 29:48.720
and never let Li Zhen
stir up any more trouble!

29:48.720 --> 29:50.000
Benchang, don't worry.

29:50.000 --> 29:50.960
Tian Benchang,

29:51.200 --> 29:54.000
you ordered the man to frame
the Li family for illicit foreign trade,

29:54.000 --> 29:54.720
didn't you?

29:57.240 --> 29:58.390
Whatever I do

29:58.850 --> 30:00.210
is none of your concern.

30:01.200 --> 30:03.530
Illicit foreign trade is a capital crime.

30:03.720 --> 30:05.440
What you've done won't just destroy Zhen,

30:05.440 --> 30:08.100
but also the dozen or so members
of the Li family!

30:08.200 --> 30:09.030
Why?

30:09.030 --> 30:10.030
Why would you do something like this?

30:10.030 --> 30:11.430
Li Zhen forced my hand.

30:12.730 --> 30:14.000
She colluded with Luo Wenqian

30:14.000 --> 30:15.740
and ruined my plans again and again.

30:15.740 --> 30:17.170
If I didn't act,

30:17.200 --> 30:18.240
there would be no place left for us

30:18.240 --> 30:19.750
in the Huizhou ink industry!

30:19.750 --> 30:22.590
Zhen grew up with us!

30:23.400 --> 30:25.800
Do you have even
a shred of conscience left?

30:25.960 --> 30:27.870
You've done all manner of wicked things.

30:27.870 --> 30:29.510
Aren't you afraid of divine retribution?

30:29.510 --> 30:31.170
You ungrateful backstabber!

30:31.750 --> 30:32.350
Brother.

30:33.510 --> 30:35.110
Don't act like some saint.

30:35.830 --> 30:38.270
You're nothing but a worthless woman
the Xu family sent back.

30:38.270 --> 30:40.590
If you can't stay obediently at home,

30:40.750 --> 30:42.240
then get out of this house!

30:45.920 --> 30:47.050
Go back to your room.

31:00.780 --> 31:02.380
Is that batch of goods ready?

31:03.830 --> 31:06.560
Everything has been arranged
as you instructed.

31:07.680 --> 31:11.000
But with all the rumors outside right now,

31:11.410 --> 31:14.670
are we really going to transport the ink
at a time like this?

31:15.040 --> 31:16.110
Remember this—

31:16.400 --> 31:18.800
if we can't give Wu Weishi
the money on time,

31:18.990 --> 31:20.680
I won't get the post
in the Directorate of Imperial Household,

31:20.680 --> 31:22.750
and all our efforts will be wasted!

31:24.310 --> 31:25.370
And if Commander Wu

31:25.970 --> 31:28.010
decides to wash his hands of us,

31:30.160 --> 31:31.270
both you and I

31:32.850 --> 31:34.850
will be guilty of a capital offense.

31:38.920 --> 31:40.050
This batch of ink...

31:42.720 --> 31:43.680
must go out.

31:45.440 --> 31:46.240
But...

31:48.920 --> 31:49.480
Okay.

31:49.640 --> 31:50.440
Out with it!

31:53.440 --> 31:56.500
But what about the money
that still hasn't been raised?

31:58.800 --> 32:01.350
If only Ronghua were still
under the Xu family's care,

32:01.350 --> 32:02.880
we could still rely on them.

32:03.200 --> 32:03.790
Now...

32:06.550 --> 32:07.790
Ronghua...

32:10.100 --> 32:13.830
[Princess's Mansion, Nanjing]

32:20.510 --> 32:22.790
Li Zhen greets Your Highness.

32:22.920 --> 32:27.250
May Your Highness enjoy blessings,
longevity, and prosperity in all things.

32:29.110 --> 32:30.510
I've already heard about

32:30.550 --> 32:32.070
your family's troubles.

32:32.840 --> 32:34.960
If you've come to plead for your family,

32:34.960 --> 32:36.160
you may leave.

32:36.480 --> 32:37.590
I can't help you.

32:38.510 --> 32:40.160
Your Highness, I did not come today

32:40.160 --> 32:41.920
to plead for my family.

32:42.550 --> 32:44.440
Your Highness must be aware that

32:44.550 --> 32:47.160
due to the disputes involving
the Li, Tian, and Luo families,

32:47.160 --> 32:50.040
Marshal Qi has been impeached
by Commander Wu of Nanjing.

32:50.040 --> 32:51.410
I am here this time

32:51.440 --> 32:52.680
to ask Your Highness

32:53.070 --> 32:56.160
if there is anything I can do for you

32:56.350 --> 32:57.410
and for Marshal Qi.

32:58.200 --> 32:59.330
What does Marshal Qi

33:00.580 --> 33:02.220
have to do with me?

33:03.200 --> 33:04.240
I heard

33:04.270 --> 33:06.640
that Japanese pirates were rampant
a few years ago,

33:06.640 --> 33:08.590
and they once invaded Fujian,

33:08.960 --> 33:10.440
murdering and plundering.

33:10.440 --> 33:11.720
The prosperous villages they attacked

33:11.720 --> 33:13.440
often suffered terrible losses.

33:13.440 --> 33:15.440
Fortunately, Marshal Qi arrived
with his troops

33:15.440 --> 33:17.110
and protected the region.

33:17.750 --> 33:20.240
Among the villages he saved

33:20.400 --> 33:22.310
was

33:22.590 --> 33:24.030
Du Village, the hometown

33:24.680 --> 33:27.110
of Your Highness's mother,
the Noble Consort.

33:27.110 --> 33:28.110
I believe

33:28.400 --> 33:29.880
Her Grace must be grateful
for the kindness

33:29.880 --> 33:32.410
Marshal Qi showed
in protecting her clansmen

33:32.430 --> 33:33.330
and would surely not wish to

33:33.330 --> 33:35.980
see him slandered and framed by others.

33:38.030 --> 33:39.110
Kindness?

33:40.790 --> 33:44.310
Kindness is the most useless thing
in the imperial court.

33:46.000 --> 33:47.270
I also know

33:48.350 --> 33:49.810
that among all the princes

33:50.030 --> 33:51.590
in the Capital,

33:51.880 --> 33:53.920
the one closest to you

33:53.920 --> 33:55.380
is His Highness Prince Yu.

33:55.680 --> 33:57.070
And at the imperial court,

33:57.070 --> 33:59.960
Commander Wu has repeatedly tried to
steal Marshal Qi's credit,

33:59.960 --> 34:01.720
claiming the achievements of

34:01.720 --> 34:03.400
the anti-piracy campaign as his own.

34:03.400 --> 34:05.270
Fortunately, Prince Yu stepped forward

34:05.270 --> 34:06.200
and fought hard on Marshal Qi's behalf,

34:06.200 --> 34:08.550
which is why Marshal Qi's reputation
remains intact today.

34:08.550 --> 34:10.010
So I would venture to guess

34:10.230 --> 34:12.480
that the people
least willing to see Marshal Qi

34:12.480 --> 34:14.280
brought down by Commander Wu now

34:15.670 --> 34:16.670
are Your Highness

34:17.280 --> 34:18.550
and Prince Yu.

34:22.920 --> 34:24.150
Rise and speak.

34:24.840 --> 34:26.300
Thank you, Your Highness.

34:29.630 --> 34:30.550
Your Highness,

34:31.000 --> 34:32.030
to speak plainly,

34:32.510 --> 34:34.280
I want to save my family

34:34.550 --> 34:36.670
and also help Marshal Qi.

34:37.550 --> 34:39.409
I ask nothing from Your Highness.

34:39.530 --> 34:42.159
I ask only that you regard me
as a blade wielded

34:42.190 --> 34:44.360
on behalf of Your Highness and Marshal Qi.

34:44.360 --> 34:46.920
Even if it means throwing myself
into the fray and being destroyed,

34:46.920 --> 34:48.190
I will not hesitate.

34:52.440 --> 34:54.360
I'd like to hear

34:55.620 --> 34:57.270
what you can do for me.

34:57.880 --> 34:58.960
I swear on my life

34:59.280 --> 35:00.880
to fight against the Tian family,

35:00.880 --> 35:03.510
find evidence of
Commander Wu's collusion with them,

35:03.510 --> 35:06.840
eliminate the menace
for you and Prince Yu,

35:07.230 --> 35:09.030
and ensure Marshal Qi's safety.

35:14.760 --> 35:16.420
This maid has made inquiries.

35:16.710 --> 35:19.320
A post in the Directorate of Imperial Household
is indeed vacant.

35:19.320 --> 35:21.030
Previously, Wu Ru pulled strings

35:21.030 --> 35:22.840
to give it to
the Tian family of Tribute Ink.

35:22.840 --> 35:24.630
But a few days ago, someone
from a noble family in the Capital

35:24.630 --> 35:26.920
also tried to take it
through their connections.

35:26.920 --> 35:28.630
If the Tian family still wants the post,

35:28.630 --> 35:31.840
they'll likely need to
spend several thousand taels more.

35:31.840 --> 35:32.710
Otherwise,

35:33.070 --> 35:35.230
all their efforts will be in vain.

35:37.150 --> 35:38.510
I've given you

35:39.190 --> 35:40.720
the guidance you asked for.

35:41.360 --> 35:43.150
If you can strike a fatal blow,

35:43.590 --> 35:45.070
your family will be safe.

35:46.150 --> 35:48.480
But if anything goes wrong in the process,

35:49.670 --> 35:50.960
I will not protect you.

35:51.480 --> 35:52.480
I understand.

35:53.030 --> 35:55.440
Thank you, Your Highness.

36:04.030 --> 36:05.070
Cuiqiao.

36:05.110 --> 36:05.800
Zhen.

36:09.960 --> 36:12.110
Someone is competing with Tian Benchang

36:12.110 --> 36:14.920
for the post
in the Directorate of Imperial Household?

36:14.920 --> 36:17.230
But what does that have to do
with their illicit foreign trade?

36:17.230 --> 36:18.360
Ever since Wenqian

36:18.360 --> 36:20.630
visited the Tian family's
contraband ink workshop at night,

36:20.630 --> 36:22.070
Tian Benchang has hidden

36:22.070 --> 36:23.070
all the traces.

36:23.280 --> 36:25.670
But now that someone is competing with him
for the post,

36:25.670 --> 36:27.510
he surely won't let
all his efforts go to waste.

36:27.510 --> 36:28.880
Even at great risk,

36:29.010 --> 36:30.710
he will continue to raise money

36:30.710 --> 36:32.030
to bribe Wu Ru.

36:33.670 --> 36:34.840
In that case,

36:35.150 --> 36:37.880
the Tian family will continue
their illicit foreign trade in secret.

36:37.880 --> 36:39.550
As long as they keep at it,

36:39.800 --> 36:41.330
we'll have leads to follow.

36:43.320 --> 36:44.800
No wonder the refugees said

36:44.800 --> 36:45.840
some of them

36:45.920 --> 36:47.850
have gone missing again recently.

36:48.710 --> 36:51.570
Could the Tian family be using
the same trick again—

36:51.960 --> 36:54.220
abducting refugees to make ink for them?

36:55.030 --> 36:55.920
Cuiqiao,

36:56.150 --> 36:57.590
during the time I was in Nanjing,

36:57.590 --> 36:59.520
did the Tian family make any moves?

37:02.000 --> 37:03.110
There is one thing,

37:03.150 --> 37:04.960
but please don't get upset
when you hear it.

37:04.960 --> 37:06.030
Tian Benchang

37:06.150 --> 37:07.590
apparently believes
that relying on Wu Ru alone

37:07.590 --> 37:08.790
isn't secure enough.

37:08.880 --> 37:11.110
Word is he has arranged to
marry Tian Ronghua off

37:11.110 --> 37:12.800
as a concubine to Vice Minister Liu

37:12.800 --> 37:15.700
at the Ministry of Personnel in Nanjing,
a man of considerable influence.

37:15.700 --> 37:16.960
Pushing his own sister

37:16.960 --> 37:18.760
into misery once wasn't enough—

37:19.190 --> 37:21.520
now he's using her
to trade for his future.

37:21.630 --> 37:23.360
That poor girl.

37:23.510 --> 37:24.320
Is that true?

37:24.850 --> 37:25.960
The wedding is being rushed.

37:25.960 --> 37:28.060
I heard the dowry is already
fully prepared,

37:28.060 --> 37:29.800
and she is scheduled to wed in three days.

37:29.800 --> 37:30.590
Beast.

37:31.360 --> 37:32.670
At a time like this,

37:32.750 --> 37:33.800
Tian Benchang is still bent on

37:33.800 --> 37:35.660
selling his own sister for glory.

37:35.710 --> 37:37.190
He's worse than an animal.

37:38.280 --> 37:39.110
Indeed.

37:40.440 --> 37:42.040
Of all times, it has to be now.

37:43.920 --> 37:44.840
Cuiqiao,

37:44.960 --> 37:46.220
could you do me a favor?

37:46.360 --> 37:47.230
Go ahead.

37:50.110 --> 37:52.370
You call being married off to some old man

37:53.510 --> 37:55.640
as his concubine a "glorious future"?

37:55.920 --> 37:58.550
Whoever thinks it's such an honor
can marry him themselves.

37:58.550 --> 37:59.960
I won't.

38:01.960 --> 38:03.110
Sister, Sister.

38:03.800 --> 38:04.590
Sit.

38:05.840 --> 38:06.510
Sister,

38:06.800 --> 38:09.000
all girls have to get married eventually.

38:09.000 --> 38:10.360
If you ask me,

38:10.400 --> 38:13.190
those first two times
don't count as real marriages.

38:13.190 --> 38:15.920
This time, our brother
has arranged everything.

38:16.300 --> 38:19.830
He will definitely marry you off
in full ceremony and splendor.

38:34.710 --> 38:35.770
If you don't marry,

38:36.360 --> 38:38.150
how am I supposed to
rely on you to put in a good word

38:38.150 --> 38:39.550
for me with Lord Liu

38:40.000 --> 38:43.860
and help me secure the post
in the Directorate of Imperial Household?

38:50.000 --> 38:51.230
At this point,

38:52.150 --> 38:53.150
it's not up to you.

39:00.880 --> 39:02.610
Whether you're willing or not,

39:03.150 --> 39:05.550
I'll make sure you get on
that bridal sedan.

39:10.920 --> 39:12.180
Keep a close eye on her.

39:12.230 --> 39:14.360
Don't let her cause any trouble for me.

39:14.550 --> 39:15.190
Yes.

39:15.630 --> 39:16.960
Bensheng, come with me.

39:36.920 --> 39:39.920
My Lady, Taisheng Shop has
sent over the silks for you.

39:41.230 --> 39:42.440
Take them to the storehouse.

39:42.440 --> 39:43.070
Yes.

39:43.360 --> 39:44.090
Come with me.

39:57.400 --> 39:58.840
Zhen, why are you here?

39:58.920 --> 40:01.880
I heard about your marriage
and came to see you right away.

40:01.880 --> 40:03.440
Is it true?

40:04.550 --> 40:06.800
When all is said and done,
our family has wronged you.

40:06.800 --> 40:08.150
I know you mean well,

40:08.150 --> 40:09.480
but don't try to persuade me anymore.

40:09.480 --> 40:10.590
Go quickly before my elder brother

40:10.590 --> 40:11.360
finds you.

40:11.440 --> 40:12.280
Ronghua,

40:12.710 --> 40:13.800
even now, you still don't know

40:13.800 --> 40:17.210
what your elder brother has been doing
behind everyone's backs.

40:17.210 --> 40:18.790
For his own future, he has colluded with

40:18.790 --> 40:21.210
the Nanjing Garrison Commander's son
and secretly engaged in illicit foreign trade.

40:21.210 --> 40:22.540
It's a capital offense.

40:22.800 --> 40:24.600
If he keeps going down this path,

40:24.880 --> 40:27.280
your family will eventually be destroyed.

40:27.480 --> 40:28.810
Illicit foreign trade?

40:28.840 --> 40:30.760
The reason our family was framed

40:30.760 --> 40:32.630
was that we uncovered his secret.

40:32.670 --> 40:34.030
That's why he's been doing everything

40:34.030 --> 40:35.400
he can to silence us.

40:35.440 --> 40:36.150
Otherwise,

40:36.440 --> 40:37.400
how could those Japanese coins

40:37.400 --> 40:39.730
have suddenly appeared in our household?

40:40.000 --> 40:41.000
So,

40:41.670 --> 40:44.440
while he's been secretly doing
all those wicked deeds behind my back—

40:44.440 --> 40:46.570
causing the Xu family to cast me aside—

40:47.000 --> 40:47.760
he's now

40:48.110 --> 40:49.970
forcing me into another marriage

40:50.070 --> 40:51.760
for his own gain.

40:54.070 --> 40:56.480
I've already asked Cuiqiao
to inquire about it.

40:56.480 --> 40:58.360
The Vice Minister Liu you are marrying

40:58.360 --> 41:00.510
will retire in one or two months.

41:00.710 --> 41:02.230
Your brother isn't marrying you

41:02.230 --> 41:04.230
to him for influence or protection,

41:04.760 --> 41:06.620
but for the generous bride price.

41:07.360 --> 41:08.280
Bride price?

41:09.800 --> 41:12.760
Tian Benchang can only secure that post
in the Directorate of Imperial Household

41:12.760 --> 41:14.890
by spending a few thousand more taels.

41:15.110 --> 41:16.320
And Vice Minister Liu

41:16.440 --> 41:17.760
has some family fortune

41:17.760 --> 41:19.190
and is known to be lustful.

41:19.190 --> 41:21.880
So your brother had someone
introduce you to him

41:22.110 --> 41:23.800
and even asked for an exorbitant price,

41:23.800 --> 41:25.660
demanding 1,000 taels of silver.

41:28.110 --> 41:29.710
So you're saying

41:32.000 --> 41:33.480
he's selling me

41:34.960 --> 41:36.760
to buy himself an official post?

41:38.070 --> 41:39.110
And there's more.

41:40.280 --> 41:41.680
That 1,000 taels is still

41:41.800 --> 41:44.000
not enough for him to get that position.

41:44.670 --> 41:45.760
Think about it—

41:45.840 --> 41:46.880
why is he rushing

41:47.400 --> 41:49.660
your wedding through at a time like this?

41:49.800 --> 41:51.320
He must be up to something,

41:51.320 --> 41:52.920
using your wedding as cover.

41:53.960 --> 41:54.710
Ronghua,

41:55.150 --> 41:56.670
have you noticed

41:57.070 --> 41:58.920
anything unusual
about Tian Benchang lately,

41:58.920 --> 42:00.320
or any suspicious people

42:00.320 --> 42:02.450
coming and going from your household?

42:03.110 --> 42:04.480
Zhen, you don't know.

42:04.710 --> 42:06.000
Ever since I came back,

42:06.110 --> 42:08.640
he's been guarding against me
in everything.

42:08.880 --> 42:11.150
The people who came to arrange the dowry
these past few days

42:11.150 --> 42:12.440
are all new faces.

42:12.800 --> 42:13.590
Some of them

42:13.630 --> 42:16.030
don't even sound like locals from Huizhou.

42:17.880 --> 42:18.670
Dowry?

42:20.670 --> 42:22.550
He's probably going to use your dowry

42:22.550 --> 42:24.360
to smuggle
that batch of contraband ink out,

42:24.360 --> 42:26.590
to raise the money he needs
to buy the post.

42:26.590 --> 42:27.990
Ronghua, think about it.

42:28.000 --> 42:29.860
With the heat this high right now,

42:29.960 --> 42:31.220
he couldn't blatantly

42:31.220 --> 42:32.960
smuggle the batch of ink out.

42:33.070 --> 42:34.870
But no one would think to inspect

42:35.760 --> 42:38.020
the dowry of the Tian family's daughter.

42:40.080 --> 42:42.040
He truly is my dear brother.

42:43.000 --> 42:45.130
Once you get on the bridal sedan chair,

42:45.440 --> 42:47.280
you become an accomplice to the crime.

42:47.280 --> 42:49.360
If it's discovered,
you won't be able to defend yourself.

42:49.360 --> 42:51.030
The punishment will be severe.

42:51.030 --> 42:51.880
Ronghua,

42:52.630 --> 42:53.920
in Tian Benchang's eyes,

42:53.920 --> 42:55.710
you are not his sister.

42:56.190 --> 42:57.440
You're just a tool
for his illicit foreign trade

42:57.440 --> 42:58.960
and a commodity to be sold.

43:00.880 --> 43:01.960
Zhen, tell me,

43:03.710 --> 43:04.590
what should I do?
